      "id": "UHR-01",
      "chapter": "global",
      "anchor": "global-hom-covering",
      "title": "Covering the lattice of integral rectangular maps",
      "statement": "For source rank a, target rank b, minimum source size L and maximum target size H, the covering radius in all complex frames is at most ab√f dH/(2L).",
